OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy in the east in the
OL,6,Fmorning with outbreaks of mostly light
OL,7,Frain, becoming mostly dry through the
OL,8,Fafternoon with bright spells. Drier
OL,9,Fwith brighter weather for Dumfries and
OL,10,FGalloway. The odd sharp afternoon
OL,11,Fshower. Breezy around the east coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers soon fading out
OL,14,Fto leave a dry night with some clear
OL,15,Fspells in the east, generally cloudier
OL,16,Fin the west. Winds falling light.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA dry morning with good
OL,19,Fbright or sunny spells. Outbreaks of
OL,20,Frain will spread east through the
OL,21,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
